
🔹 What is Selenium?

Selenium is an open-source automation testing tool used to test web applications.

It automates browser actions like clicking, typing, navigating, and validating UI behavior.

It supports multiple programming languages such as Java, Python, C#, JavaScript.

🔹 Components of Selenium

Selenium WebDriver – Automates browsers directly (most used).

Selenium IDE – Record & playback tool (good for beginners).

Selenium Grid – Runs tests on multiple browsers and machines in parallel.
